WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.842
For a mortgage, the bank usually asks for life

2
00:00:02.842 --> 00:00:05.093
cover for the amount and term of the loan.

3
00:00:05.396 --> 00:00:07.126
The policy is assigned to the bank,

4
00:00:07.126 --> 00:00:09.842
so the loan is paid off if something happens.

5
00:00:10.942 --> 00:00:13.380
With two borrowers, ask whether both

6
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.272
must be insured and for what amount.

7
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.509
Ask whether the bank accepts a policy from an insurer of your choice.

8
00:00:19.754 --> 00:00:20.902
And allow time:

9
00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:23.004
depending on age and amount,

10
00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:25.860
health questions or tests may be required.

11
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.722
The cover the bank asks for pays off the loan;

12
00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:32.393
it does not replace the family’s income.

13
00:00:32.695 --> 00:00:34.657
That is why it is worth seeing whether your

14
00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:37.280
family needs something more for its income.

15
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.307
When the loan changes, check that

16
00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:42.361
the cover still matches the balance.

17
00:00:42.548 --> 00:00:45.091
And it is best to look at the life cover before

18
00:00:45.091 --> 00:00:48.422
the loan is signed, so the approval is not delayed.

19
00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:53.132
The bank also asks for home cover against fire and earthquake.

20
00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:56.371
It is wise to check the sum insured at every renewal

21
00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:00.377
and after any renovation or extension, so that it matches

22
00:01:00.377 --> 00:01:03.476
today’s cost of rebuilding the home for its square metres,

23
00:01:03.604 --> 00:01:07.458
not its market value, and the home is not under-insured.

24
00:01:08.558 --> 00:01:10.914
For a first conversation with no commitment,

25
00:01:10.915 --> 00:01:14.803
call plus three five seven, nine seven, eight four zero,

26
00:01:14.862 --> 00:01:17.764
nine four one, or send a WhatsApp message.
